Package: fasterKRR
Title: Fast Kernel Ridge Regression
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Clade Code Opus 4.6", "User", email = "devnull@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R translation of fast_krr Python package by Pratik Rathore.
    Provides fast kernel ridge regression through a simplified two-function
    API: CreateFullKRR() for exact models and CreateInducingKRR() for
    scalable inducing-point approximations. Supports multiple optimizers
    (PCG, EigenPro, ASkotch, Mimosa) and preconditioners (Newton, Nystrom,
    Falkon, partial Cholesky) selected via simple string arguments.
